  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rLocation Plan\rExisting & Propsoed Front Elevation 00-XX-GK-345890-01 0\rExisting Ground Floor 00-XX-GK-345890-05 0\rExisting Rear Elevation 00-XX-GK-345890-06 0\rExisting Side Elevation 00-XX-GK-345890-06 0\rProposed Ground Floor 00-XX-GK-345890-01 0\rProposed Rear Elevation 00-XX-GK-345890-03 0\rProposed Side Elevation 00-XX-GK-345890-04 0\rDesign and Access Statement\rVentilation Assessment 20/04/2026\rANNEX C: RISK ASSESSMENT FOR ODOUR\rNOISE IMPACT ASSESSMENT REPORT - KITCHEN EXTRACTION SYSTEM\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "All new external works shall be carried out in materials that resemble, as closely as possible in colour and texture to those used in the existing building, unless otherwise specified in the approved plans.\r\rReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area.\r",
    "Prior to first use of the extract flue hereby approved, the Ventilation Assessment including Annex C undertaken by GOYA WORKS LTD dated 20th April 2026 and the Noise Impact Assessment Report - Kitchen Extraction System undertaken by GOYA WORKS LTD dated 15th April 2026 must be fully installed. The system must thereafter be retained for the lifetime of the development, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: To prevent noise disturbance and the expulsion of harmful odours, and to safeguard the residential amenities of surrounding residential occupants.\r"
  ],
